title: "Duty-cycled machine-learning perception monitors as periodically inspected protection channels"
abstract: >-
  Code, frozen evaluation protocol and event-level derived data for a delay-time
  inspection model of duty-cycled machine-learning perception monitors, with an
  event-to-event law of the per-invocation detection probability.
